<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>BackBarButtonItem on 快乐每一天</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/tags/backbarbuttonitem/</link><description>Recent content in BackBarButtonItem on 快乐每一天</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.153.3</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Nov 2011 09:48:52 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.zgia.net/tags/backbarbuttonitem/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>自定义UINavigationController的后退按钮标题</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/2011/11/%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89uinavigationcontroller%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8E%E9%80%80%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Nov 2011 09:42:14 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.zgia.net/2011/11/%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89uinavigationcontroller%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8E%E9%80%80%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A视图进入B视图，如下，self指的A，bView指的B。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-objectivec" data-lang="objectivec"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;[self.navigationController pushViewController:self.bView animated:YES];
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;一开始想当然的，在B视图的viewDidLoad里直接使用：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-txt" data-lang="txt"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;self.navigationItem.backBarButtonItem.title = @&amp;#34;back&amp;#34;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;来更改后退按钮标题，结果后退后，发现A视图的导航栏标题也变成“back”了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>